---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { SITE_URL, PHOTO_FIELD } from '../data/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Story | Car Wash Management"
  description="Civic detailing, MCCS contracts, then a chemical plant. The operator origin of Car Wash Management."
  canonical={`${SITE_URL}/about`}
  pageKey="about"
>
  <section class="cwm-mkt-hero">
    <div class="cwm-mkt-hero-bg">
      <img src={PHOTO_FIELD} alt="" />
    </div>
    <div class="cwm-mkt-hero-content">
      <span class="cwm-eyebrow">Story</span>
      <h1>Not a boardroom origin.</h1>
      <p>Detailing from a Civic. Then Marine Corps Community Services. Then chemistry and PM.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="cwm-chapter">
    <figure class="cwm-chapter-photo">
      <img src={PHOTO_FIELD} alt="Field work" width="1000" height="1200" />
    </figure>
    <div class="cwm-chapter-copy">
      <p class="cwm-mono">Origin</p>
      <h2>Civic, then MCCS, then a plant.</h2>
      <p>
        After losing a job, the founder offered mobile detailing from an old Honda Civic, going door
        to door.
      </p>
      <p>
        Slow seasons meant buying equipment and client lists from shops that had closed. One of those
        paths led to the United States Marine Corps.
      </p>
      <p>
        On-site he helped repair a struggling MCCS car wash. Repair became maintenance. Studying FAR
        and writing compliant proposals led to contracts on military installations, including Marine
        Corps Base Hawaii, plus warehousing and distribution.
      </p>
      <p>Integrity. Transparency. Compassion. No awards theater. No invented quotes.</p>
      <a href="/book-a-call" class="cwm-text-link">Book a consult</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
